c8f3: $ … ⇒ dt u M t4 W R = ∅ $ by ex_elim [c8e3, c8f4]
c8e2: $ G , ∃ x1 ∃ e ∃ x2 ∃ f (t1 = x0 ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_proj , a +: x1 +: e +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x2 ∧ t4 = ⟨ kc_proj , a +: x1 +: f +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_inst x0 e x2 f ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ e ∃ x2 ∃ f (t1 = x0 ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_proj , a +: x1 +: e +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x2 ∧ t4 = ⟨ kc_proj , a +: x1 +: f +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_inst x0 e x2 f ∈ lrel) $ by ax
c8f2: $ … ⇒ dt u M t4 W R = ∅ $ by ex_elim [c8e2, c8f3]
c8e1: $ G , ∃ a ∃ x1 ∃ e ∃ x2 ∃ f (t1 = x0 ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_proj , a +: x1 +: e +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x2 ∧ t4 = ⟨ kc_proj , a +: x1 +: f +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_inst x0 e x2 f ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ a ∃ x1 ∃ e ∃ x2 ∃ f (t1 = x0 ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_proj , a +: x1 +: e +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x2 ∧ t4 = ⟨ kc_proj , a +: x1 +: f +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_inst x0 e x2 f ∈ lrel) $ by ax
c8f1: $ … ⇒ dt u M t4 W R = ∅ $ by ex_elim [c8e1, c8f2]
