t5: $ … ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ p1_clp u M w → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ p1_clp u M w $ by imp_intro [t4]
t6: $ … ⇒ k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ p1_clp u M w → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ p1_clp u M w $ by imp_intro [t5]
t7: $ … ⇒ ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ p1_clp u M w → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ p1_clp u M w) $ by all_intro [t6]
t8: $ … ⇒ ∀ k ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ p1_clp u M w → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ p1_clp u M w) $ by all_intro [t7]
t9a: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
t9: $ … ⇒ trees ω ⊆ p1_clp u M w $ by trees_ind_c [t9a, t8]
