g1: $ H , n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = h ∧ e = h ∧ ra_closed x3 h ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le x3 x1 ∈ lrel , i ∊ nvf' x3 ⇒ i ∊ nvf' x3 $ by ax
g2: $ H , n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = h ∧ e = h ∧ ra_closed x3 h ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le x3 x1 ∈ lrel , i ∊ nvf' x3 ⇒ nvf' x3 ⊆ cdm a $ by weaken [v3]
