lemma p2_k_proj (H: hyps) (M: class) (u w n m s k z e a r o c j x0 x1 b x2 h i: set) {d: set}: $ H ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ H ⇒ m ∊ fseq u $ > $ H ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ > $ H ⇒ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → m' (nvf' n + d) = s' d) $ > $ H ⇒ crn j ⊆ p2_lp u M w n m s $ > $ H ⇒ z = ⟨ c , j ⟩ $ > $ H ⇒ ⟨ kr_lift , n +: k +: z +: e +: ∅ ⟩ ∈ lrel $ > $ H ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ > $ H ⇒ cdm a = nvf' k $ > $ H ⇒ r = a ++ m $ > $ H ⇒ o = a ++ s $ > $ H ⇒ (n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: h +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: i +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 h i ∈ lrel) → dt u M e w r = dt u M z w o $
----
f1: $ H , n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: h +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: i +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 h i ∈ lrel ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#1]
f2: $ H , n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: h +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: i +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 h i ∈ lrel ⇒ m ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#2]
f3: $ H , n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: h +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: i +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 h i ∈ lrel ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#3]
f5: $ H , n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: h +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: i +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 h i ∈ lrel ⇒ crn j ⊆ p2_lp u M w n m s $ by weaken [#5]
f6: $ H , n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: h +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: i +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 h i ∈ lrel ⇒ z = ⟨ c , j ⟩ $ by weaken [#6]
f7: $ H , n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: h +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: i +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 h i ∈ lrel ⇒ ⟨ kr_lift , n +: k +: z +: e +: ∅ ⟩ ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#7]
f8: $ H , n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: h +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: i +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 h i ∈ lrel ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#8]
f9: $ H , n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: h +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: i +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 h i ∈ lrel ⇒ cdm a = nvf' k $ by weaken [#9]
f10: $ H , n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: h +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: i +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 h i ∈ lrel ⇒ r = a ++ m $ by weaken [#10]
f11: $ H , n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: h +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: i +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 h i ∈ lrel ⇒ o = a ++ s $ by weaken [#11]
p0: $ H , n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: h +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: i +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 h i ∈ lrel ⇒ n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: h +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_proj , b +: x2 +: i +: ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 h i ∈ lrel $ by ax
