l21y7: $ … ⇒ r2' nvf' i = p' nvf' i $ by eq_trans [l21y5, l21y2]
l21y8: $ … ⇒ p' nvf' i = r2' nvf' i $ by eq_sym [l21y7]
l21: $ … ⇒ r1' nvf' i = r2' nvf' i $ by eq_trans [l21y6, l21y8]
l22: $ … ⇒ dt u M ⟨ kc_bvar , i +: ∅ ⟩ w r1 = r2' nvf' i $ by eq_trans [l10, l21]
