o10: $ G , c = cdm p , c ∊ ω , n = nvf' i , n ∊ ω , d ∊ ω ∧ c + d = n ⇒ n = nvf' i $ by ax
o11: $ … ⇒ nvf' i = n $ by eq_sym [o10]
o12: $ … ⇒ nvf' i = cdm p + d $ by eq_trans [o11, o9]
