o20: $ … ⇒ r1' nvf' i = r2' (suc (nvf' i)) $ by eq_trans [o18, o19]
p1: $ G , c = cdm p , c ∊ ω , n = nvf' i , n ∊ ω ⇒ c ∊ ω $ by ax
p2: $ G , c = cdm p , c ∊ ω , n = nvf' i , n ∊ ω ⇒ n ∊ ω $ by ax
