m0y2: $ … ⇒ isset kr_inst $ by wcel_isset [m0y1]
m0y3: $ … ⇒ k ∊ trees ω ∧ v ∊ trees ω ∧ a ∊ trees ω ∧ y ∊ trees ω $ by lrel_args4 [#18, m0y2]
m0y4: $ … ⇒ k ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [m0y3]
m0y5: $ … ⇒ v ∊ trees ω ∧ a ∊ trees ω ∧ y ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [m0y3]
m0y6: $ … ⇒ v ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [m0y5]
m0y7: $ … ⇒ a ∊ trees ω ∧ y ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [m0y5]
m0y8: $ … ⇒ a ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [m0y7]
m0y9: $ … ⇒ y ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [m0y7]
