m0y11: $ … ⇒ v ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [m0y6]
m0y12: $ … ⇒ a ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [m0y8]
m0y13: $ … ⇒ y ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [m0y9]
m0y14: $ … ⇒ a ∈ trees ω ∧ y ∈ trees ω $ by and_intro [m0y12, m0y13]
m0y15: $ … ⇒ v ∈ trees ω ∧ a ∈ trees ω ∧ y ∈ trees ω $ by and_intro [m0y11, m0y14]
m0: $ … ⇒ k ∈ trees ω ∧ v ∈ trees ω ∧ a ∈ trees ω ∧ y ∈ trees ω $ by and_intro [m0y10, m0y15]
m2: $ … ⇒ v ∈ trees ω ∧ a ∈ trees ω ∧ y ∈ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [m0]
m3: $ … ⇒ v ∈ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [m2]
m4: $ … ⇒ a ∈ trees ω ∧ y ∈ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [m2]
m5: $ … ⇒ y ∈ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [m4]
i1: $ … ⇒ dt u M y w r1 = dt u M v w r2 $ by p3_ih_n [l11, #18, #2, #3, #4, #5, #6, #7, #9, #11]
d1: $ … ⇒ dt u M ⟨ kc_proj , b +: i +: y +: ∅ ⟩ w r1 = (dt u M y w r1)' (suc (nvf' i)) $ by dt_proj [t5, t8, m5, #1, #10]
d2: $ … ⇒ dt u M ⟨ kc_proj , b +: i +: v +: ∅ ⟩ w r2 = (dt u M v w r2)' (suc (nvf' i)) $ by dt_proj [t5, t8, m3, #1, #12]
d3a: $ G ⇒ suc (nvf' i) = suc (nvf' i) $ by eq_refl
