u0y14: $ … ⇒ a ∈ trees ω ∧ q ∈ trees ω $ by and_intro [u0y12, u0y13]
u0y15: $ … ⇒ n ∈ trees ω ∧ a ∈ trees ω ∧ q ∈ trees ω $ by and_intro [u0y11, u0y14]
u0: $ … ⇒ v ∈ trees ω ∧ n ∈ trees ω ∧ a ∈ trees ω ∧ q ∈ trees ω $ by and_intro [u0y10, u0y15]
u2: $ … ⇒ n ∈ trees ω ∧ a ∈ trees ω ∧ q ∈ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [u0]
