yx1: $ G , v = ⟨ kc_s , k +: ∅ ⟩ ⇒ p ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#2]
yx2: $ G , v = ⟨ kc_s , k +: ∅ ⟩ ⇒ cdm p = nvf' k $ by weaken [#3]
yx3: $ G , v = ⟨ kc_s , k +: ∅ ⟩ ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#4]
yx4: $ G , v = ⟨ kc_s , k +: ∅ ⟩ ⇒ x0 = dt u M a w s $ by weaken [#5]
yx5: $ G , v = ⟨ kc_s , k +: ∅ ⟩ ⇒ x0 ∊ u $ by weaken [#6]
